The fruits is a list of 1, 2, 3, 2, and 2.
The lastfruit is -1.
The priorfruit is -1.
The lastcount is 0.
The priorcount is 0.
The held is 0.
The best is 0.
For each fruit in fruits.
If fruit is lastfruit, add 1 to lastcount.
If fruit is priorfruit, set held to lastcount, set lastcount to priorcount plus 1, set priorcount to held, set priorfruit to lastfruit, set lastfruit to fruit.
If fruit is not lastfruit and fruit is not priorfruit, set priorfruit to lastfruit, set priorcount to lastcount, set lastfruit to fruit, set lastcount to 1.
The span is lastcount plus priorcount.
If span is more than best, set best to span.

Show best.
